        "empty_penalty": 0.0,
        "core_concepts": 2,
        "action_points": 1,
        "empty_words": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "- **反例**：排查问题时，上来就优化查询链路、调日志过滤、翻代码逻辑；结果发现项目ID看错了",
      "source": "selfgen_20260818_210557_0037",
      "type": "cog",
      "density": 1.0,
      "density_grade": "S",
      "density_details": {
